          "tz": 600
        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 kunit: add shared mock_tgt lu_tgt_desc helper",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 kunit: add shared mock_tgt lu_tgt_desc helper\n\nAdd mock_tgt.ko, a KUnit helper module providing a mock target (a\ndt_device + obd_export + struct lu_tgt_desc, as found in a\nlu_tgt_descs table's ltd_tgt_pool/ltd_qos) with canned statfs\nreplies, an unavailability state (down, full, read-only, no create,\ndegraded, no precreated objects) and OSS/MDS node grouping. struct\nlu_tgt_desc is common infrastructure used by both LOD (OST targets)\nand LMV (MDT targets), so this mock is written against that shared\nAPI rather than anything LOD- or LMV-specific, letting several test\nmodules share one fake target implementation instead of each\nhand-rolling its own.\n\nNo test consumes it yet; later test commits depend on mock_tgt.ko.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [Augment Code]\nChange-Id: I2dacaa3748faccb1d7087ae5689ff316dcab455b\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
